    <teaserBodytext>
      <Value Culture="de-de"><![CDATA[{
  "markup": "<p>Software as a Service (SaaS) wird laut Microsoft CEO Satya Nadella in naher Zukunft durch KI-Agenten abgelöst. Macht die Beschäftigung mit entsprechender Software da überhaupt noch Sinn?</p>",
  "blocks": {
    "contentData": [],
    "settingsData": []
  }
}]]></Value>
      <Value Culture="en-us"><![CDATA[{
  "markup": "<p>According to Microsoft CEO Satya Nadella, Software as a Service (SaaS) will be replaced by AI agents in the near future. Does it even make sense to work with such software anymore?</p>",
  "blocks": {
    "contentData": [],
    "settingsData": []
  }
}]]></Value>
